sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant ExportAPI as Export API
    participant ValidationSvc as Mermaid Validator
    participant ExportSvc as Export Logic
    participant DB as Database
    participant Storage as Blob Storage
    
    User->>UI: Select assets to export
    User->>UI: Choose export format & destination
    UI->>ExportAPI: POST /api/projects/{id}/export
    ExportAPI->>DB: Retrieve asset details
    DB-->>ExportAPI: Return asset data
    
    ExportAPI->>ValidationSvc: Validate diagram syntax
    ValidationSvc-->>ExportAPI: Return validation result
    
    ExportAPI->>ExportSvc: Process export request
    ExportSvc->>ExportSvc: Generate export file
    ExportSvc->>Storage: Store export file
    Storage-->>ExportSvc: Return file URL
    
    alt destination is "download"
        ExportSvc-->>ExportAPI: Return download URL
        ExportAPI-->>UI: Return export result with URL
        UI-->>User: Prompt download
    else destination is "email"
        ExportSvc->>ExportSvc: Send email with export
        ExportSvc-->>ExportAPI: Confirm email sent
        ExportAPI-->>UI: Return export confirmation
        UI-->>User: Display confirmation
    else destination is "external" (GitHub/Jira)
        ExportSvc->>ExportSvc: Create content in external system
        ExportSvc-->>ExportAPI: Return external link
        ExportAPI-->>UI: Return link to external system
        UI-->>User: Display link to external system
    end
